WEBVTT

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:07.580
<i>In this city where we live,
there are two kinds of people.</i>

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.650
<i>One kind is the "natives".</i>

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:13.720
<i>Pure humans, who grew up
just as they were born.</i>

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:15.620
<i>The other kind
is the "resembles".</i>

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:18.830
<i>By mechanizing parts of their bodies,
these people complement</i>

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:22.530
<i>and sometimes dramatically
enhance their physical abilities.</i>

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.630
<i>And now,</i>

00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:28.140
<i>a completely new being distinct
from those two has been born.</i>

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:31.410
<i>A being whose entire body
is composed of machinery...</i>

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:36.010
<i>A being many scientists dreamed of,
but could never realize...</i>

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:40.920
<i>With reverence, such a being
is called thus among scientists:</i>

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:42.580
<i>A "genuine".</i>

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:49.090
<i>Having said that, this has absolutely
nothing to do with this story.</i>

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:26.430
Damn.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:28.020
<i>I guess I have no choice.</i>

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:33.030
<i>I'll hide it there for now and...</i>

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.750
<i>Wow!</i>

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:49.720
<i>What a large bath!</i>

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:52.190
<i>I keep telling you it's a
hot spring health resort!</i>

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:53.020
<i>Hot spring health resort?</i>

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:56.220
<i>- Taking a day off in a place like
this once in a while is nice.
- Sheesh! I told you
all this before we left!</i>

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.790
<i>- This is a place where you go swimming!
- Hold on a second.</i>

00:01:57.790 --> 00:02:00.230
<i>Why is Silvia here?</i>

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:01.200
<i>Uh, um, well...</i>

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:04.600
<i>- I'll retrieve it real quick
and keep it all to myself.
- I think I'll have something
to eat before going for a swim.</i>

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:05.660
<i>Hey, listen when I'm talking!</i>

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:15.080
<i>You know the continuation of the fairy tale
I've wanted to hear about?</i>

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:23.250
<i>If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand</i>

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:33.230
<i>It's like we were both seeking
a coincidence that was off by a page</i>

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:35.400
<i>And that's how fate
brought us together</i>

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:43.570
<i>More than those words
that you once kept to yourself</i>

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:52.480
<i>It's the kindness that made you
keep them to yourself</i>

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:59.490
<i>That I want to have
faith in now</i>

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:07.130
<i>You know, we'll be living alongside
uncertainty from now on</i>

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:13.540
<i>We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now</i>

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:21.240
<i>You know the continuation of the fairy tale
I didn't know about before?</i>

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:27.480
<i>If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand</i>

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:31.320
<i>It's something to build up
bit by bit</i>

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:43.060
<i>"Waterside Panic"</i>

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:45.560
<i>Okay, Solty!</i>

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.330
<i>Solty!</i>

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:02.010
<i>Hey, she...</i>

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.520
<i>Oh, no need to worry.</i>

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:09.420
<i>Current resemble technology
is perfectly waterproof, too.</i>

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:13.930
<i>Perhaps we should've gone
to the pool for resembles after all?</i>

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:15.530
<i>Maybe.</i>

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.830
<i>Welcome!</i>

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:20.400
<i>Would you care
to order anything else?</i>

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.400
<i>What a conscience that we'd
meet in a place like this.</i>

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.940
<i>That's "coincidence".</i>

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:26.070
<i>Who is she?</i>

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:27.440
<i>No idea.</i>

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.710
<i>Some waitress
working part time.</i>

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:30.980
<i>Hey!</i>

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:33.150
<i>Then, could I order
some more items?</i>

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:36.620
<i>I like being showered with attention,</i>

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.390
<i>but I hate being ignored!</i>

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:41.020
<i>So she says...</i>

00:04:41.020 --> 00:04:43.090
<i>I don't know what I don't know.</i>

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:45.020
<i>It's no use playing dumb!</i>

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:46.960
<i>You sure you don't have
the wrong person?</i>

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:52.130
<i>Solty's with you, too!
You still plan to play dumb?!</i>

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:53.790
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.740
<i>So, what are you trying to get at?</i>

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:01.240
<i>Let's see...
A coconut milk and...</i>

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:04.010
<i>- Oh, sure. A coconut milk...
- Also, two orange juices
and two oolong teas, I think.</i>

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:06.480
<i>- There's just one thing
I want to say to you.
- And for something to eat, too...</i>

00:05:06.480 --> 00:05:08.510
<i>- Don't interfere with my work!
- Three hot dogs.</i>

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:10.150
<i>Because it'll be
a pain if you do.</i>

00:05:10.150 --> 00:05:12.720
<i>Work?
Interfere?</i>

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:14.190
<i>You mean your work
as a waitress?</i>

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.590
<i>No!</i>

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.990
<i>Well, something like that.</i>

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:19.730
<i>Like how?</i>

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:21.630
<i>Like this.</i>

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:23.730
<i>You're not making any sense.</i>

00:05:23.730 --> 00:05:25.830
<i>Don't be so irritable.</i>

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:29.200
<i>They're free tickets from one of those
contests you're always entering, right?</i>

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.140
<i>How did you know that?!</i>

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:36.210
<i>There were four tickets
and I felt bad wasting them, so...</i>

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:39.010
<i>So it was you!</i>

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:41.710
<i>Owowow!</i>

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:44.380
<i>Now, since Integra
had to work on our day off,</i>

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.720
<i>I'm going to play extra hard
to make up for it!</i>

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:52.950
<i>I wanted to go, too.</i>

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:05.370
<i>Yes? This is Security Department,
Special Duty Section 7.</i>

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.510
What?

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:07.770
Having said that...

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:10.240
<i>Well, the kind of interference
you people could muster up</i>

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:14.510
<i>wouldn't have any effect
on the great Rose's impeccable work.</i>

00:06:14.510 --> 00:06:17.250
<i>Rose? As in that thief?</i>

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:20.320
<i>Yes, I am!</i>

00:06:20.320 --> 00:06:22.020
<i>This is ridiculous.</i>

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:25.160
<i>As if I'd babysit you when it's
not even part of a job.</i>

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:26.860
<i>Besides, I'm off duty today.</i>

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:28.230
<i>Oh, really.</i>

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:32.500
<i>In that case, it saves me from
having to deal with you, old man.</i>

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:36.370
<i>Hey, where do you think
you're taking that?</i>

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:37.570
<i>Do you want to know?</i>

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:38.370
<i>Not really.</i>

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:41.040
<i>Then I'll tell you!</i>

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.910
<i>I wonder if she doesn't listen
to what other people say.</i>

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:45.340
<i>Most likely.</i>

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:47.580
<i>You see it on that
pallet, don't you?</i>

00:06:47.580 --> 00:06:50.650
<i>That an emerald with a market
value of several billion traz</i>

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:53.320
<i>was stolen from the RUC Art Museum.</i>

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:57.050
<i>Would you believe it if I said
that emerald's in here?</i>

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:01.230
<i>The stolen emerald is here?</i>

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.530
<i>Yes, there's apparently
a high probability that it is.</i>

00:07:04.530 --> 00:07:06.300
<i>It's a Level B order.</i>

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.930
<i>Find the stolen emerald.</i>

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:11.640
<i>This is our first
day off in a long time.</i>

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:14.510
<i>And I'm not even
getting to enjoy that.</i>

00:07:14.510 --> 00:07:17.640
<i>Do your best and don't
complain. Bye.</i>

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:24.620
<i>So, the person who stole the emerald
from the art museum yesterday...</i>

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.920
<i>Yes, I do!</i>

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:30.490
<i>It was the beautiful thief,
Rose the Blue Meteor!</i>

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:35.930
<i>"Impeccable work" my ass.
It's all over the news.</i>

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.530
<i>It's a performance, okay?
A performance.</i>

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:42.070
<i>The newspapers need some
sensational stories every so often,</i>

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:44.300
<i>or they'll start
to lose downloads.</i>

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:47.540
<i>Oh, I remember receiving
an order about that.</i>

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:52.410
<i>Something about a 10% reward
for whoever recovers the emerald.</i>

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:54.850
<i>10%? That makes it
several hundred million?</i>

00:07:54.850 --> 00:08:00.590
<i>Boy, do I hate greedy adults,
who think of everything in terms of money.</i>

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:01.920
<i>You're in no position to say that!</i>

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.860
<i>I wonder if she's the type
who doesn't see her own failings?</i>

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.490
<i>Most likely.</i>

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:10.700
<i>Talk about a thief taking
a high and mighty attitude!</i>

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:13.170
<i>I wonder what kind of fools
your parents are.</i>

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:14.530
<i>Sorry to disappoint you,</i>

00:08:14.530 --> 00:08:17.700
<i>but both my mother and father
have retired from thieving long ago</i>

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:20.140
<i>and live out in the country now.</i>

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:23.380
<i>Oh, Miss Rose...</i>

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:26.910
<i>So like I said,
don't interfere!</i>

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:28.010
All right...

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:33.680
<i>But well... I know full well
that you can more than hold your own.</i>

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:43.400
<i>If you get tired of the old man,
you can come to me anytime.</i>

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:46.400
<i>I'll recruit you
to become a thief.</i>

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:48.200
<i>I see...</i>

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.340
<i>See you around.</i>

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:53.810
<i>I am closed for business today.</i>

00:08:53.810 --> 00:08:56.500
<i>It's work.
You know that, don't you?</i>

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:02.820
<i>Th-That's strange...</i>

00:09:02.820 --> 00:09:04.420
Wasn't that...

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:07.320
<i>Wh-Why are you hiding with me, too?!</i>

00:09:07.320 --> 00:09:09.660
<i>Well, I just did.</i>

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:13.090
<i>I never expected them
to be here, too.</i>

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.720
<i>Do you know them?</i>

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.970
<i>They're with the RUC's
Security Division.</i>

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:25.200
<i>They're a separate
organization from the police.</i>

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.710
<i>A special forces unit
that reports directly to the RUC.</i>

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:32.180
<i>They're sort of like
the RUC's own hunters.</i>

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:34.110
<i>I-I see.</i>

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:36.280
<i>I've never gone up
against them directly,</i>

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:39.850
<i>but to us, they're like our
natural enemy. Our natural enemy.</i>

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:43.660
<i>But well, the prize
is in my hands already.</i>

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:48.360
<i>It doesn't make a difference
to me if they show up now.</i>

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:49.590
What?!

00:09:53.430 --> 00:09:55.700
<i>Huh? Not much is coming out.</i>

00:09:57.870 --> 00:09:59.810
<i>Shoot! I made a mistake!</i>

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.100
<i>Made a mistake?</i>

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:07.850
<i>What do I do? What do I do?!
Think! Rose!</i>

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:09.520
<i>Um, Miss Rose...</i>

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:12.280
<i>What?! I'm busy right now!</i>

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:15.650
<i>Why are you doing this, Miss Rose?</i>

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:17.450
<i>Stealing things...</i>

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:28.030
<i>What the heck?
Is there some lump in there?</i>

00:10:28.030 --> 00:10:29.500
<i>Something's rattling around in there.</i>

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.370
<i>What if it's the stolen
emerald that's in there?</i>

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:34.610
<i>No way.</i>

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:37.740
<i>Have you ever gone
to the lowest level?</i>

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.710
<i>What? Um, no.</i>

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:44.550
<i>It's no place
for people to live in.</i>

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:46.310
It's a trash dump.

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:51.290
<i>The underground city has been
abandoned and it's no longer used.</i>

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:54.290
<i>Unregistered residents
who aren't registered with the city...</i>

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:57.930
<i>Just for being incompetenters,
they can't go to hospitals</i>

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:59.900
<i>or even attend school.</i>

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:03.470
<i>Needless to say, no good jobs
are available to them</i>

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:08.870
<i>and since there's no police presence,
it's become a den of criminals.</i>

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:12.180
<i>But even so, the city
won't do anything for us.</i>

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:14.380
<i>If you actually try to get
registered, they ask you,</i>

00:11:14.380 --> 00:11:15.980
<i>"Do you have the registration fees?</i>

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:18.470
<i>What about referrals from people
who will vouch for you?"</i>

00:11:20.120 --> 00:11:23.710
<i>If we had those things,
no one would be suffering!</i>

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:30.000
<i>And this mere piece of art
is worth several billion?!</i>

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.330
<i>You've got to be kidding me!</i>

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.900
<i>If you've got
that kind of money,</i>

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:36.570
<i>you should spend it
for the good of the people!</i>

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:38.130
<i>That's why I steal.</i>

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.830
But...

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:45.880
<i>I understand.</i>

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:46.810
What?

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:50.680
<i>Hey!</i>

00:11:52.220 --> 00:11:53.410
<i>Excuse me.</i>

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.720
<i>Hey, you're...</i>

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:01.660
<i>Please give that to me.</i>

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:03.000
This?

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.090
<i>Yes.</i>

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.110
Why?

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:18.010
<i>Because...</i>

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:21.000
<i>Because there are people's
lives depending on it!</i>

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:24.040
Huh?

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.250
<i>You idiot.</i>

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:44.300
<i>There are people's lives
depending on this?</i>

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.640
<i>On this?</i>

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.610
<i>Yes.</i>

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:49.640
<i>Are you serious?</i>

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:51.110
<i>Yes!</i>

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:52.510
<i>You sure we don't
need to stop her?</i>

00:12:52.510 --> 00:12:54.110
<i>Leave her alone.</i>

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:57.350
<i>You know, I don't know what kind
of prank you're trying to pull,</i>

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:58.920
<i>but this thing belongs
to this establishment</i>

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:02.120
<i>and it's not up to me to decide
whether to give it to you or not.</i>

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:05.590
<i>Even so, I still want it.</i>

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:07.230
<i>You're a stubborn one.</i>

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:10.360
<i>I absolutely need it.</i>

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:13.070
<i>Many people's lives can be saved...</i>

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:15.300
<i>...with the...</i>

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:17.670
<i>...with the emerald inside that thing!</i>

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:19.000
What?!

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.710
<i>You're Rose Anderson!</i>

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.830
<i>All right, I have it now!</i>

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:40.850
<i>Oh, no, you don't!</i>

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:47.260
<i>You're not getting away with this!</i>

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.600
<i>Why you!</i>

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.500
<i>I will not allow you
to get in Miss Rose's way!</i>

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:57.340
<i>Got it!</i>

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:58.740
<i>Starting water hose!</i>

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.400
What?!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.750
<i>What shall we do?</i>

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:10.890
<i>They've started something over there!</i>

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.420
<i>Leave them alone.</i>

00:14:12.420 --> 00:14:16.490
<i>Darn it, where has Miranda
gone at a time like this?!</i>

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.670
<i>I wonder if it's all right to be
in a place like this at a time like this?</i>

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:25.470
<i>It's okay, it's okay.</i>

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:28.370
<i>Roy said to leave things alone.</i>

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:32.280
<i>More importantly, whoever gets out
first pays for ice cream, okay?</i>

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.570
<i>Yes, Dear.</i>

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:40.220
<i>Man, she's so worked up.</i>

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:43.060
<i>Oh, there's an e- mail from work.</i>

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:44.760
<i>I haven't seen or heard anything.</i>

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:48.960
<i>It says we get a special bonus
if we recover the emerald.</i>

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:50.460
<i>Let's do this, Accela.</i>

00:14:50.460 --> 00:14:53.270
<i>Come on, get a move on!</i>

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:55.230
<i>Money sure is scary.</i>

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:05.010
<i>I got it!</i>

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:07.500
<i>L-Let go!
That tickles!</i>

00:15:13.120 --> 00:15:14.150
<i>I got...</i>

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.050
What?!

00:15:15.050 --> 00:15:16.490
<i>You're not getting it!</i>

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.760
<i>One more time!</i>

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.630
<i>Talk about persistent!</i>

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.130
<i>Water hose!</i>

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.710
<i>Hand over!</i>

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:41.540
<i>That gem!</i>

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.220
<i>They're scary!</i>

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:49.120
<i>It is okay. There is nothing
to be scared of now.</i>

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:52.820
<i>If you would not mind, would you
please give me that emerald?</i>

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.100
<i>Here!</i>

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.800
<i>Just like that?!</i>

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:04.140
<i>I got it!
I got it!</i>

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:07.440
<i>Oh, but where do I need to take this?</i>

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.410
<i>Rock, paper, scissors!</i>

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:16.010
<i>The bonus is mine now!</i>

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:18.120
<i>Please give it back!</i>

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.380
What's with this girl?

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:20.320
<i>Accela!</i>

00:16:25.760 --> 00:16:27.090
<i>Hand it over!</i>

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:30.460
Um... Um...

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.400
<i>Next person!</i>

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.230
What?!

00:16:33.230 --> 00:16:34.570
<i>You just...</i>

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.830
...hand that...

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:38.440
<i>...over here!</i>

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:40.100
<i>Mr. Yuto!</i>

00:16:43.840 --> 00:16:46.280
<i>Solty!</i>

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:50.920
<i>You're all machine, and yet
your body is completely seamless.</i>

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:53.020
<i>Your Al, capable
of independent thought,</i>

00:16:53.020 --> 00:16:55.720
<i>is pure, naive,
and slightly lacking.</i>

00:16:55.720 --> 00:17:00.060
<i>And above all else,
that innocent smile!</i>

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:03.060
<i>Could it be...</i>

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:04.660
...that this is...

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.830
<i>...love!</i>

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:11.670
<i>O my feelings,
may they reach you!</i>

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.410
<i>Oh, what a hugely wild pitch!</i>

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.500
<i>Moron!</i>

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:29.190
<i>Welcome to the aquatic circus!</i>

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.420
<i>Here is our very own
golden duo on the trapeze,</i>

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:35.590
<i>Riley Awl and...</i>

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:39.800
<i>...Furyk Smith in our
aquatic trapeze show!</i>

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:40.700
<i>Move!</i>

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.140
<i>What? U-Um, excuse me...</i>

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:44.070
<i>Please move aside!</i>

00:17:44.070 --> 00:17:45.040
<i>H-Hey!</i>

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:48.460
<i>I will get it back,
no matter what!</i>

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.370
<i>Solty!</i>

00:17:58.720 --> 00:17:59.950
<i>- Mine!
- I will take it!</i>

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.690
<i>Not so fast,
Long Ears!</i>

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:05.280
<i>You're awful, Celica!
My swimsuit!</i>

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.700
<i>That was dangerous!</i>

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.500
<i>Oh, sorry about that.</i>

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:20.840
<i>This time...</i>

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.170
<i>Without fail!</i>

00:18:35.290 --> 00:18:36.380
<i>She's going to crash!</i>

00:18:45.260 --> 00:18:46.530
<i>You idiot!</i>

00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:50.900
<i>Hurry up and cut the power!</i>

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.960
<i>E-Easy for you to say...</i>

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.230
<i>A-Almost there!</i>

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.410
<i>Solty!</i>

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:25.300
<i>Oh, Miss Rose...</i>

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:30.040
<i>What were you thinking?
You almost died out there!</i>

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:31.370
<i>I am sorry.</i>

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:38.520
<i>This was all I could get.</i>

00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:43.560
<i>And we were so close
to saving lots of people...</i>

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:46.830
This was all...

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:48.290
<i>I am sorry.</i>

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:55.500
<i>You dummy.
I was half joking.</i>

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.940
<i>Even down there,</i>

00:19:57.940 --> 00:20:00.730
<i>everyone's leading
pretty happy lives.</i>

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:08.780
<i>Is that true?</i>

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:12.550
<i>It's true.</i>

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.660
<i>Then, I am glad!</i>

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.490
<i>I like you.</i>

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:23.830
<i>Won't you seriously
consider becoming a thief?</i>

00:20:23.830 --> 00:20:24.730
What?

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:26.000
<i>Hey.</i>

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.490
<i>What are you doing?
We're going home.</i>

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:31.390
Okay.

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:38.410
<i>Man, we got nothing
for our troubles.</i>

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:39.610
<i>I'm exhausted.</i>

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:43.980
<i>At the very least, I'm going to
catch that Rose Anderson!</i>

00:20:43.980 --> 00:20:47.110
<i>I'll be expecting a positive
response from you, Solty.</i>

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:51.410
<i>Hey, hold it right there!</i>

00:20:56.260 --> 00:20:58.750
<i>Rose Anderson!</i>

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:03.060
<i>Sheesh, that's one rowdy girl.</i>

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:13.850
<i>Concerning the emerald that was stolen
from the RUC Art Museum...</i>

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:18.150
<i>I am very sorry. It seems
we failed to recover it.</i>

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:22.850
<i>Oh, there's no need
for you to apologize.</i>

00:21:22.850 --> 00:21:25.690
<i>It was just something
Section 1 asked for anyway.</i>

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:30.060
<i>It's of little importance,
even if we failed.</i>

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:32.000
<i>Besides,</i>

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.730
<i>it seems to have yielded
some interesting things.</i>

00:21:53.420 --> 00:21:58.190
<i>On a clear day in the park</i>

00:21:58.190 --> 00:22:01.120
<i>Looking up at the sky</i>

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:12.370
<i>There was a tiny little cloud
that almost vanished</i>

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:17.140
<i>Letting the wind
take us where it will</i>

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:20.080
<i>We live freely</i>

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:28.120
<i>We make our way,
walking a little at a time</i>

00:22:28.120 --> 00:22:32.890
<i>We're the same</i>

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:37.660
<i>This precious time</i>

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:41.500
<i>Each time we meet</i>

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:51.040
<i>This feeling of not being alone
turns into kindness</i>

00:22:51.040 --> 00:22:57.380
<i>I can turn it into the courage
to believe in someone</i>

00:22:57.380 --> 00:23:09.820
<i>And surely, before I vanish
into the far reaches of that sky...</i>

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:18.570
<i>What Mr. Roy is looking for...</i>

00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:21.040
<i>What he's continued to look for...</i>

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:23.170
<i>Next time, "Beloved Daughter".</i>

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:25.770
<i>I would like for him
to find her, too.</i>
